  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support women entrepreneurs, farmers, and cooperatives&#x2014;especially in rural and underserved communities&#x2014;to safely andconfi dently use digital fi nancial tools to grow their income, formalize their businesses, and reduce fi nancial risks. It will also strengthen women-ledSMEs, helping them adopt greener business practices and create new economic opportunities, including green jobs for youth.</narrative>
  </description>
